 * after filter, the range shrinks to (10,20), there are 10 distinct values in (10,20).
 * there are two value, e.g. 10 and 20, are in (10, 20).
 * the selectivity is 2 / 10.
 *
 * A.selectivity = 2/40:
 * the table after filter keeps 2/40 rows
 *
 * B.selectivity = 5/20
